Z||000000||Philphine||11-06-2000||01:04 PM||||<BR>could some one explain the difference and what year this change was made. is it the same year across the board or is it different with various engines. from what little i know obd II should be avoided for computer complications or something like that but i'd like to be sure. <P>just trying to glean all the info i can in hopes of a future engine swap.<P>------------------<BR>Phil T<P>'87 coupe (feral)<BR>'84 indy<BR>'84 coupe (cheap thrill)||||reg||1
